title Run Reminders: card rewards
section Outside fights
character Ironclad
relic add BING_BONG
relic add STRIKE_DUMMY
relic add LUCKY_FYSH
act UNDERDOCKS
fight CULTISTS_NORMAL 3
wait combat-started
hp player 56
kill all
wait 4
card-reward POMMEL_STRIKE SHRUG_IT_OFF TWIN_STRIKE
wait 2
caption On a card reward: a tab on each offered card for the relics taking it sets off (Bing Bong copies it, Lucky Fysh gives gold) and for relics that make it stronger in fights (Strike Dummy on the Strikes).
shot card-reward full
